ent-KamertonReactorCore = Kamerton reactor core
    .desc = The heart of the Kamerton reactor. Everything else is assembled around it.
ent-KamertonStableFuelArray = Kamerton stable fuel array
    .desc = A cradle for super-energy cells. The cells hum quietly inside it.
ent-KamertonUnstableFuelArray = Kamerton unstable fuel array
    .desc = A cradle for unstable super-energy cells. Red light flickers between its contacts.
ent-KamertonSynchronizer = Kamerton synchronizer
    .desc = Tunes stable and unstable cells to one frequency, so they ring together like a tuning fork.
ent-KamertonHeatSink = Kamerton heat sink
    .desc = A heavy finned pipe running through the reactor shell. Gas flowing through it carries the reactor heat away.
ent-KamertonRadiator = Kamerton radiator
    .desc = A dense heat block that soaks up reactor heat and hands it on to its neighbours.
ent-KamertonSuppressor = Kamerton suppressor
    .desc = A segment of the suppressor ring that keeps redspace inside the reactor.
ent-KamertonPowerUnit = Kamerton power unit
    .desc = Feeds the reactor output into the high-voltage network.
ent-KamertonReactorCoreFlatpack = Kamerton reactor core flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack used for constructing a Kamerton reactor core. Unpack it with a multitool.
